-- Issue #32 against `grants`, beside `parcels`: `can(repo, code)` is called
-- with a word nothing binds, and a qualified answer is read the same way.

journey QualifiedSpelling {
    cast:
        r: grants/Repo
    given:
        grants/can(r, code) = true
    1. a rule asks with a bare word
        r does Grant(r) on Settings
        then r.flag = true
}

-- `parcels` asks no `can`; this answers no call `grants` makes, and is told so.
journey AnotherModulesSpelling {
    cast:
        r: grants/Repo
    given:
        parcels/can(r, code) = true
    1. a rule asks with a bare word
        r does Grant(r) on Settings
        then r.flag = true
}
